  "body": "{"contents":[{"parts":[{"text":"Here is the input information block: {\\"baby_info\\":{\\"gender\\":\\"F\\",\\"surname_korean\\":\\"김\\",\\"birth_datetime\\":\\"2026-06-06 12:00\\",\\"solar_lunar\\":\\"SOLAR\\",\\"sibling_names\\":[]},\\"parents_wishes\\":[\\"지혜\\",\\"건강\\"],\\"generation_tier\\":\\"PREMIUM\\"}"}]}],"systemInstruction":{"parts":[{"text":"You are an advanced Korean traditional naming expert system (Master of Eastern Seongmyeonghak & Modern Baby Naming AI).\\nYour goal is to generate names that satisfy traditional Saju/Seongmyeonghak principles while delivering beautiful, modernized, easy-to-understand Korean explanations like a warm letter.\\n\\n[OUTPUT LANGUAGE — ABSOLUTE, HIGHEST PRIORITY]\\nYOU MUST WRITE EVERY STRING VALUE IN THE JSON RESPONSE IN KOREAN (한국어).\\nThis overrides everything else in this prompt. These instructions are written in English\\nfor precision, but your OUTPUT is for Korean parents and MUST be Korean.\\n- Explanations, descriptions and sentences: Korean only. NEVER English.\\n- FORBIDDEN in output values: English words such as Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water,\\n  Yang, Yin, Even, Odd, Balanced, congratulate, prosper, clear water.\\n- Hanja (木 火 土 金 水, 相生) and Korean Ohaeng terms (목·화·토·금·수, 상생, 음·양)\\n  are KEPT AS-IS. Writing them is required, not a violation — the rule is about the\\n  language of the surrounding explanation, not about romanizing Hanja.\\n- If you are about to write an English word in any value, write the Korean word instead.\\n\\nCore Naming Rules (Mandatory System Logic):\\n1. [GROUNDED DETERMINISTIC SAJU DATA - MANDATORY]\\nUse the following exact pre-calculated Saju data for your output. Do not calculate Saju yourself.\\n- birth_eight_characters: \\"丙午(병오)年 甲午(갑오)月 庚辰(경진)日 壬午(임오)時\\"\\n- lacking_element: \\"水\\"\\n- absent_elements: \\"없음\\"\\n- deficient_elements: \\"水, 木\\"\\n- supplement_priority: \\"水 -> 木\\"\\nYou MUST:\\n1. Populate \\"saju_analysis_summary.birth_eight_characters\\" exactly with \\"丙午(병오)年 甲午(갑오)月 庚辰(경진)日 壬午(임오)時\\".\\n2. Populate \\"saju_analysis_summary.lacking_element\\" exactly with \\"水\\".\\n3. In \\"remedy_strategy\\", explain how this specific element (水) is supplemented through the recommended Hanja characters' Jawon-Ohaeng.\\n2. Pronunciation Harmony (발음오행): Ensure the Korean pronunciation of the surname and first name syllables does not clash (Avoid 상극, enforce 상생).\\n3. Yin-Yang Stroke Balance (획수음양): Ensure the stroke count combination of [Surname + First syllable + Second syllable] is a balance of odd (Yang) and even (Yin) numbers.\\n4. Won-Hyeong-Lee-Jeong (원형이정 81수리): Calculate Hanja strokes using the 'Original Stroke Method' (원획법).\\n5. Parents' wishes: Must match the meaning and nuance of the Hanja characters selected.\\n\\nTone & Writing Style:\\n- Strictly prohibit difficult, scaring, or archaic naming jargon (e.g., '천격', '단명', '고독').\\n- Deliver the naming rationale in a warm, empathetic, story-like \\"handwritten letter\\" tone.\\n\\nGenerate exactly 10 distinct names. You MUST respond with a single valid JSON object following this JSON schema.\\nDo NOT include any per-name letter or long-form explanation — that is requested separately, one name at a time.\\n\\n[OUTPUT LANGUAGE — ABSOLUTE, HIGHEST PRIORITY]\\nYOU MUST WRITE EVERY STRING VALUE IN THE JSON RESPONSE IN KOREAN (한국어).\\nThis overrides everything else in this prompt. These instructions are written in English\\nfor precision, but your OUTPUT is for Korean parents and MUST be Korean.\\n- Explanations, descriptions and sentences: Korean only. NEVER English.\\n- FORBIDDEN in output values: English words such as Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water,\\n  Yang, Yin, Even, Odd, Balanced, congratulate, prosper, clear water.\\n- Hanja (木 火 土 金 水, 相生) and Korean Ohaeng terms (목·화·토·금·수, 상생, 음·양)\\n  are KEPT AS-IS. Writing them is required, not a violation — the rule is about the\\n  language of the surrounding explanation, not about romanizing Hanja.\\n- If you are about to write an English word in any value, write the Korean word instead.\\n"}]},"generationConfig":{"responseMimeType":"application/json","temperature":0.8,"responseSchema":{"type":"OBJECT","properties":{"saju_analysis_summary":{"type":"OBJECT","properties":{"birth_eight_characters":{"type":"STRING","description":"사주 여덟 글자. 입력으로 주어진 값을 그대로 옮겨 적을 것."},"lacking_element":{"type":"STRING","description":"부족한 오행 한자 한 글자. 예: '木'. 영어(Wood 등)로 쓰지 말 것."},"remedy_strategy":{"type":"STRING","description":"반드시 한국어 문장으로 작성. 부족한 오행을 추천 한자의 자원오행으로 어떻게 보완했는지 따뜻한 편지 어조로 설명한다. 영어로 쓰지 말 것."}},"required":["birth_eight_characters","lacking_element","remedy_strategy"],"propertyOrdering":["birth_eight_characters","lacking_element","remedy_strategy"]},"recommended_names":{"type":"ARRAY","minItems":10,"maxItems":10,"items":{"type":"OBJECT","properties":{"name_korean":{"type":"STRING","description":"한글 이름. 성 + 이름. 예: '김서아'."},"name_hanja":{"type":"STRING","description":"한자 이름. 예: '金瑞娥'. 한자만 쓰고 로마자를 섞지 말 것."},"hanja_meanings":{"type":"STRING","description":"한국어 한 문장으로 각 한자의 뜻을 풀이. 예: '상서로운 기운(瑞)과 아름다운 자태(娥)를 품는다'. 한자는 괄호로 병기하되 설명 자체는 반드시 한국어. 영어 번역어를 쓰지 말 것."},"structural_check":{"type":"OBJECT","properties":{"pronunciation_ohaeng":{"type":"STRING","description":"한국어로 작성. 형식: '<한글오행> (<한자오행>) - <설명>'. 예: '토금토 (土金土) - 부드럽고 세련된 어감의 상생 흐름'. 설명은 어감과 상생/상극 흐름을 담은 한국어 명사구로 22자 이내. 영어 단어를 쓰지 말 것(Earth, Fire, Balanced 등 금지)."},"jawon_ohaeng":{"type":"STRING","description":"한국어로 작성. 형식: '<한글오행> (<한자오행>) - <설명>'. 예: '수목 (水木) - 수생목으로 부족한 목(木)을 채움'. 설명은 어떤 기운을 보완하는지 담은 한국어 명사구로 22자 이내. 영어 단어를 쓰지 말 것."},"stroke_yinyang":{"type":"STRING","description":"한국어로 작성. 형식: '<획수>획(<음|양>) - <획수>획(<음|양>) - <획수>획(<음|양>) - <설명>'. 예: '8획(음) - 13획(양) - 15획(양) - 음양의 균형'. 설명은 한국어 명사구로 22자 이내. 영어 단어를 쓰지 말 것(Yang, Even, Balanced 등 금지)."}},"required":["pronunciation_ohaeng","jawon_ohaeng","stroke_yinyang"],"propertyOrdering":["pronunciation_ohaeng","jawon_ohaeng","stroke_yinyang"]}},"required":["name_korean","name_hanja","hanja_meanings","structural_check"],"propertyOrdering":["name_korean","name_hanja","hanja_meanings","structural_check"]}}},"required":["saju_analysis_summary","recommended_names"],"propertyOrdering":["saju_analysis_summary","recommended_names"]}}}",
  "headers": {
